    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The base for these enchiladas is a tangy "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "salsa-verde"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "salsa verde"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " made from tomatoes, chilli, and lime as a substitute for tomatillos. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "rolling-tortillas"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Rolling tortillas"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " without cracking is the main skill here. A quick pass in a dry pan makes them pliable enough to fold around the filling."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: use polenta-based tortilla wraps if you cannot find corn tortillas. The texture is similar enough once smothered in sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
